1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Yıllarca tek bir

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,580
eğri odun getirmedim.

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,880
Şeyhim beni tam

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:05,400
da bu yüzden

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:05,900
kovdu.

6
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,460
Hâlâ çiğsin!

7
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:08,400
Var git bu

8
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:08,900
kapıdan!

9
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,840
Neden geç kaldın

10
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,340
Yunus'um?

11
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,100
Sohbet vakti çoktan

12
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,600
geçti.

13
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,560
Dergâha odun getiriyordum

14
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,080
Sultanım.

15
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,860
Koca Akçadağ'da

16
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,560
odun mu bitti

17
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,060
Yunus?

18
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,160
Niye bu vakte

19
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:23,560
kaldın?

20
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,680
Şeyhim,

21
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,960
düz odunları arıyordum.

22
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,320
Sizin dergâhınızdan

23
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,200
içeri odunun bile

24
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,160
eğrisi girmez dedim,

25
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,260
tek tek seçtim.

26
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,560
Bunca yıldır bu

27
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,460
kazanda kaynıyorsun,

28
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:35,100
hâlâ dünya kokarsın

29
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:35,580
Yunus!

30
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,720
Hâlâ çiğsin!

31
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,760
Var git bu

32
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:38,200
kapıdan,

33
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,100
pişmeden dönme!

34
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,600
Meğer eğrilik odunlarda

35
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,100
değil.

36
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,500
Bakan gözümdeymiş.

37
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,580
Herkesi eğri görüp

38
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,800
kendini doğru sanmakmış

39
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:58,420
asıl hamlık.

40
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:13,160
Yunus'um,

41
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:14,820
geçtin mi eğriden

42
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:15,420
doğrudan?

43
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,580
Geçtim efendim.

44
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,360
Meğer herkesler

45
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,000
doğruymuş.

46
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,440
Herkes doğrudur

47
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,380
sen doğru isen,

48
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,700
bulunmaz doğruluk

49
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:24,600
sen eğri isen.

50
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:31,180
Herkesi eğri görüyorsan,

51
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:32,820
sorun odunda değildir.

52
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,860
Sen bugün kimi

53
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:41,540
eğri gördün?

54
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,460
Yorumlara yaz.

